# UriSense Gen-2: Hardware & Sensor Interface Specification V1 

This document outlines the mixed-signal frontend, optomechanical reading chamber, and pin mapping between the **Analog Devices MAX32690EVKIT** and the UriSense Gen-2 sensor modules.

---

## 1. System Power & Voltage Domains

| Domain | Voltage | Source / Regulator | Function |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **V_CORE** | 1.1V | MAX32690 Internal SIMO Buck | Cortex-M4F core, cache, and DSP logic |
| **V_IO** | 3.3V | MAX32690EVKIT LDO Rail | Digital I/O, I2C pull-ups, ST7735 display |
| **V_REF** | 2.500V | EVKIT Onboard Ultra-Low-Drift Ref (LTC6655) | SAR ADC reference for precision EIS sampling |
| **V_OPT** | 3.3V (Filtered) | Dedicated Ferrite Bead + RC Filter | Multi-spectral optical array & LED drivers |

---

## 2. Sensor Interfacing & Pin Mapping (MAX32690 Header)

### A. Multispectral Optical Subsystem (I2C0)
* **Sensor IC:** ams OSRAM AS7341 (11-Channel Visible/NIR Spectral Engine)
* **Spectral Coverage:** 8 visible channels (415 nm to 680 nm), 1 Clear, 1 Flicker, 1 NIR (910 nm).
* **Interface:** Fast-Mode I2C (400 kHz) with 2.2 kΩ pull-ups to `V_IO`.

| MAX32690 Pin | Signal Name | Target Pin (AS7341) | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **P0.16** | `I2C0_SCL` | `SCL` | I2C Serial Clock |
| **P0.17** | `I2C0_SDA` | `SDA` | I2C Serial Data |
| **P0.18** | `GPIO_INT` | `INT` | Spectral integration completion interrupt |
| **P0.19** | `GPIO_LED_EN` | `ENABLE_LED` | Synchronous narrow-band LED driver strobe |

### B. Precision Electrochemical Impedance / Conductivity Probe (ADC0)
* **Transducer:** Gold-plated interdigital microelectrode (IDE) probe / clinical flow-cell pins.
* **Measurement Modality:** AC-coupled pseudo-sinusoidal / pulsed impedance spectroscopy for Specific Gravity (SG) and ionic osmolality.

| MAX32690 Pin | Signal Name | Conditioning Circuit | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **AIN0 (P2.0)** | `ADC_EIS_IN` | Low-noise buffer (TSV792), passive anti-aliasing filter (fc = 50 kHz) | 12-Bit SAR ADC input (sampled at 1 MSPS) |
| **P0.20** | `EIS_EXCITE` | AC excitation generator (capacitively coupled) | 1 kHz – 10 kHz excitation probe signal |
| **VREF+** | `ADC_REF_EXT` | Filtered 2.5V precision reference header | Eliminates battery rail sag artifacts |

### C. Onboard ST7735 1.45" Color TFT Display (Integrated on EVKIT)
* **Bus:** SPI1 (up to 24 MHz)
* **Display Format:** 128 × 128 RGB
* **Signals:** `SPI1_MOSI` (P0.22), `SPI1_SCK` (P0.21), `TFT_CS` (P0.24), `TFT_DC` (P0.25), `TFT_RST` (P0.26).

